  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the European Parliament&apos;s Election Observation Mission to Nigeria 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the EU EOM Nigeria 2023, a Delegation from the European Parliament, composed by 7 MEPs, 3 Secretariat staff and 3 members of Political Groups, is to be deployed to Abuja between 20 - 27 February 2023, and a specific contract is to be signed between IOM and the European Parliament to implement the logistics, security and administrative aspects of the mission.</narrative>
  </description>
